 management will consume most of the ruler\u2019s time, at some point exploration of the outside world is necessary to understand its history and present state.", "themes": [{"id": 21, "name": "Survival"}, {"id": 31, "name": "Drama"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/frostpunk", "videos": [{"id": 15726, "name": "Gameplay Trailer: Heartbeats", "video_id": "ZfVihkEqQ-M", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZfVihkEqQ-M", "title": "Frostpunk - Gameplay Trailer: Heartbeats", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZfVihkEqQ-M/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 13158, "name": "Whiteout Trailer", "video_id": "EY16kyh4Sg8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EY16kyh4Sg8", "title": "Frostpunk - Whiteout Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EY16kyh4Sg8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 20825, "name": "Survivor Mode Trailer", "video_id": "15X35dqSvCo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=15X35dqSvCo", "title": "Frostpunk Update 1.1.0 | Survivor Mode", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/15X35dqSvCo/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 9867, "name": "The Fall Teaser Trailer", "video_id": "DUSz0yeFB6Y", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DUSz0yeFB6Y", "title": "Frostpunk - The Fall Teaser Trailer (Official)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/DUSz0yeFB6Y/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 19029, "name": "Release date Trailer", "video_id": "eLGog5qPGMY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eLGog5qPGMY", "title": "Frostpunk - Release Date Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eLGog5qPGMY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 113298, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "qqEpSOFDXGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qqEpSOFDXGA", "title": "Frostpunk | Official Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qqEpSOFDXGA/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 8839, "name": "Frostpunk"}]}